This directory holds the generator of the kW Engineering CDL libraries. Its tables (quantities.json, class-map.json,
connector-points.json, clause7.json, mbl_manifest.json and the reports) and its tests contain class names, connector
and parameter names, default values and short descriptions from the Modelica Buildings Library 14.0.0 (commit
ad48324b), redistributed under its license, reproduced below. kW Engineering's own work in this directory is licensed
under the Academic Free License version 3.0. That license does not change MBL's terms for the material reproduced
from it.

hx_comps_index.json, xeto_names.json, ph_tags.json and ph_point_units.json record spec names, tag names and units
from Haxall's hx.comps library and Project Haystack's xeto libraries, both licensed under the Academic Free License
version 3.0.

